    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in one of Youghal's most sought-after residential locations on Golflinks Road, The Bungalow is a beautifully maintained four-bedroom detached residence situated just a short stroll from the stunning Youghal beachfront and scenic coastal walks.\n\nThe property was extended in 2009, with the addition of two bedrooms and a sunroom. It has since undergone extensive refurbishment and upgrading throughout, resulting in a comfortable and modern family home presented in excellent condition. These upgrades include full replumbing, full rewiring, insulation, reslated, new fascia & soffit and new windows. \n\nThe accommodation extends to four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a spacious family bathroom and bright, well-balanced living accommodation with kitchen/dining, utility, lounge. \n\nExternally, the property enjoys a private rear yard with 2 garden sheds providing valuable additional storage space or use as an office. The mature site offers excellent privacy while remaining within easy reach of all local amenities.\n\nIdeally positioned, the property benefits from immediate access to Youghal Beach, local schools, shops, sporting facilities and the recently developed Midleton to Youghal Greenway, making it an exceptional family home in a highly desirable coastal setting. The property is also conveniently located within a five-minute walk of public transport links, providing easy access to Youghal town centre and surrounding areas.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a home that offers the perfect balance of lifestyle, convenience, and coastal living. Arrange your viewing today."
      },
