        "Content": "\nHallway - \n\n\nLounge - 4.24m x 3.69m\n\n\nSunroom - 3.00m x 3.50m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 4.00m x 3.66m\n\n\nUtility Room - 1.28m x 1.90m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.25m x 2.60m\nEn-Suite\n\nEn-Suite - 1.90m x 1.28m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.19m x 3.76m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.80m x 3.00\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 43.66m x 3.10m\n\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.57m x 2.05m\n\n\n"
